=== 2. Register a client in LAGOS, read it in PORT HARCOURT one second later
$ psql -X -p 5432 -d ead -c "INSERT INTO ead.client (name, sector, state_code) VALUES ('Jos Plateau Solar Cooperative', 'ngo', 'PL') ON CONFLICT (name) DO NOTHING;"
INSERT 0 1

$ psql -X -p 5435 -d ead -c "SELECT client_id, name, state_code FROM ead.client ORDER BY client_id DESC LIMIT 3;"
 client_id |             name              | state_code 
-----------+-------------------------------+------------
        23 | Jos Plateau Solar Cooperative | PL
        20 | Unity Property Partners       | EN
        19 | Meridian Hotels               | FC
(3 rows)


=== 3. Try to write in PORT HARCOURT (expected: read-only error)
$ psql -X -p 5435 -d ead -c "INSERT INTO ead.client (name, sector, state_code) VALUES ('Should fail', 'private', 'RI');"
ERROR:  cannot execute INSERT in a read-only transaction

